    "integration_strategy": "Feature1 must implement the bug fix in the core logic before Feature2's validation tests can pass. Coordination is required to ensure that the modified conditional in pytest_runtest_makereport functions as expected and that the new test in testing/test_skipping.py accurately verifies the correct behavior.",
    "communication_needs": "Developers working on Feature1 and Feature2 should discuss the expected behavior of skip location reporting, agree on the configuration of the test environment, and ensure that shared components (such as the skip marker and its stored state) are handled consistently between the core logic and the tests."
